## 7. Condition-Based Maintenance (CBM)

### 7.1 CBM Monitoring Points

| Equipment | Monitoring Method | Parameter | Alert Threshold | Action |
|-----------|------------------|-----------|-----------------|--------|
| Stamping Presses | Vibration monitoring | Velocity (mm/s) | >4.5 mm/s | Inspect bearings |
| Hydraulic Systems | Oil analysis | Particulate count, viscosity | Per lab limits | Filter/oil change |
| Robot Servos | Motor current trend | Amp draw deviation | >15% from baseline | Inspect gearbox |
| Conveyor Drives | Thermal imaging | Temperature delta | >20°C above ambient | Inspect motor/bearings |
| Air Compressors | Vibration monitoring | Velocity (mm/s) | >7.0 mm/s | Inspect compressor |
| Gearboxes | Oil analysis | Wear metals (Fe, Cu) | Per lab limits | Inspect gears/bearings |

### 7.2 CBM Data Collection Schedule

| Monitoring Type | Frequency | Performed By |
|-----------------|-----------|--------------|
| Vibration routes | Monthly | Maintenance Technician |
| Thermal imaging | Quarterly | Maintenance Technician / Contractor |
| Oil sampling | Quarterly or per hours | Maintenance Technician |
| Motor current logging | Continuous (select equipment) | Automated / PLC |
| Ultrasonic leak detection | Quarterly | Maintenance Technician |

