## 9. Safety-Critical System Maintenance

### 9.1 Safety System PM Requirements

Safety-critical systems require documented PM with specific verification:

| System Type | PM Frequency | Verification Required |
|-------------|--------------|----------------------|
| Light curtains | Monthly | Function test with test piece |
| E-STOP circuits | Monthly | Activation test each button |
| Guard interlocks | Monthly | Function test each interlock |
| Two-hand controls | Monthly | Timing and anti-tie-down test |
| Presence sensing devices | Monthly | Detection zone verification |
| Safety PLCs | Annual | Program verification and backup |
| Fire suppression | Annual | Inspection by certified contractor |
| Emergency eyewash/showers | Weekly | Activation and flow test |

### 9.2 Safety System PM Procedure

| Step | Action | Responsibility |
|------|--------|----------------|
| 1 | Notify Production of safety system test | Maintenance Technician |
| 2 | Apply LOTO to equipment (if required for test) | Maintenance Technician |
| 3 | Perform function test per manufacturer procedure | Maintenance Technician |
| 4 | Document pass/fail for each device | Maintenance Technician |
| 5 | If fail: tag out device, notify Supervisor, initiate repair | Maintenance Technician |
| 6 | Repair and retest before returning to service | Maintenance Technician |
| 7 | Document all tests and repairs in CMMS | Maintenance Technician |
| 8 | EHS reviews safety system PM completion monthly | EHS Manager |

### 9.3 Safety System Failure Response

| Step | Action | Responsibility |
|------|--------|----------------|
| 1 | Immediately remove equipment from service | Maintenance Technician |
| 2 | Tag equipment "DO NOT OPERATE — SAFETY SYSTEM FAILURE" | Maintenance Technician |
| 3 | Notify Supervisor and EHS Manager | Maintenance Technician |
| 4 | Document failure in CMMS and safety log | Maintenance Technician |
| 5 | Repair and verify safety system function | Maintenance Technician |
| 6 | Supervisor and EHS verify repair before return to service | Supervisor + EHS |
| 7 | Document restoration and verification | Maintenance Technician |

